{"version":1,"content":"<p>旅發局主辦的「香港美酒佳餚巡禮」今日於中環海濱活動空間及添馬公園揭幕。</p><p>今年巡禮設逾340個攤位，較去年增加超過一成，巡禮將於周五和周六晚延長開放至凌晨1時。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:38.215295+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:07:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.558017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:14.749009+00:00","content_hash":"bba3254eb3307ee7f963b69c5abf82eb741f564d4c9adb8ea11b885dd525672d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}